# The Reforged patches are applied byte for byte to upstream's LF files: keep them LF on every OS
# (Git for Windows would otherwise check them out with CRLF line endings).
*.patch text eol=lf
# The server preset's hashes in preset/preset.json are of the LF files.
preset/** text eol=lf
# Shell scripts run on Linux servers: a CRLF checkout on Windows would break them when copied over.
*.sh text eol=lf
